{"id":43175,"date":"2025-07-16T11:59:16","date_gmt":"2025-07-16T10:59:16","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=43175"},"modified":"2026-08-24T06:41:25","modified_gmt":"2026-08-24T05:41:25","slug":"trail-vila-franca-naves-2025","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-vila-franca-naves-2025\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Vila Franca Naves 2025"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Prepare-se para uma experi\u00eancia \u00fanica: um Trail ao p\u00f4r do sol (Sunset)! A Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Humanit\u00e1ria de Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Vila Franca das Naves ir\u00e1 organizar a 1\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o dos Trilhos dos Her\u00f3is. Esta iniciativa visa promover um estilo de vida saud\u00e1vel e refor\u00e7ar os la\u00e7os com a comunidade.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">O evento contempla 3 provas competitivas:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\" >\n<li><strong>Trail Longo<\/strong>\u00a0(25km) \u2013 Trail dos Super Her\u00f3is<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Trail Curto\u00a0<\/strong>(15km) \u2013 Trail dos Her\u00f3is<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Trail Kids<\/strong>\u00a0(na zona envolvente do quartel) \u2013 Corrida Pequenos Her\u00f3is<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Al\u00e9m disso, haver\u00e1 a&nbsp;<strong>Caminhada dos Her\u00f3is<\/strong>&nbsp;(12km), para quem quiser participar e desfrutar de uma experi\u00eancia diferente!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":43176,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,739,498],"event_type_2":[212,726],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-43175","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry